'''Australis''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife obtainable by purchasing it individually from the [[Australis Gamepass]] for 1,699 Robux or from the [[Australis & Borealis Bundle]] for 3,399 Robux during the [[Christmas Event 2024]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==
It has a pastel pink and cyan colour on the blade and a stone-like texture to resemble the southern lights phenomenon.

==Trivia==
*It partners with the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun [[Borealis]], making the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Australis Set|Australis Set]]
*This and its partner gun are two of the twelve gamepass weapons where you had the option to buy them as part of a bundle or separately, the others being [[Soul]], [[Spirit]],  [[Pearl]], [[Pearlshine]], [[Flowerwood]], [[Flowerwood Gun|Flowerwood gun]], [[Darkshot]], [[Darksword]], [[Waves]], [[Ocean]], [[Rainbow (Godly)|Rainbow]], [[Rainbow Gun (Godly)|Rainbow Gun]], [[Sakura]], [[Blossom]], [[Phantom]], [[Spectre]], [[Plasmablade]], [[Plasmabeam]], [[Iceflake]], and [[Icebeam]].

